{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set resolveCandidates = ttm_get_resolve_affair_candidates(npc.UUID) %}

{% if resolveCandidates != "" %}Eligible partners nearby to resolve exposed affair with: {{resolveCandidates}}{% endif %}

USE WHEN {{speakingNpc.name}} and their partner verbally decide upon and settle the resolution of a known, exposed affair in their relationship.
USE ONLY WHEN an explicit decision has been spoken regarding how the relationship will proceed after the infidelity.
Resolution choices:
- "confronted": Cheater agrees to cut all ties with the affair partner and commit to reconciling with their partner.
- "allowed": Partner forgives or permits the secondary relationship, mutually transitioning their relationship into an open relationship.
- "breakup": Either party decides the betrayal is unforgivable and declares a breakup or divorce ending their primary relationship.
- Provide a concise 1st-person explanation of the decision.
NEVER use if the affair is still an unexposed secret.
NEVER use if no concrete resolution has been agreed upon or declared.
